{"id":754,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"The petals on this Pokémon’s arms are thin and super sharp, and they can fire laser beams if Lurantis gathers light first."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"This Pokémon resembles a beautiful flower. A properly raised Lurantis will have gorgeous, brilliant colors."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"As it slashes into its enemies, it looks like it’s dancing. Its elegant appearance has led some to call it the most glamorous Grass Pokémon."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"For self-protection, it pretends to be a bug Pokémon. Both of its arms bear keen-edged petals."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It fires beams from its sickle-shaped petals. These beams are powerful enough to cleave through thick metal plates."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It requires a lot of effort to maintain Lurantis’s vivid coloring, but some collectors enjoy this work and treat it as their hobby."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Leaf Guard","hidden":false,"description":"Prevents status conditions in harsh sunlight."},{"name":"Contrary","hidden":true,"description":"Reverses any stat changes affecting the Pokémon so that attempts to boost its stats instead lower them—and attempts to lower its stats will boost them."}],"eggGroups":["Grass"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Pink","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":753,"name":"Fomantis","condition":null,"children":[{"id":754,"name":"Lurantis","condition":"Lv. 34 (Day)","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,572],[1,74],[1,76],[1,210],[1,275],[1,400],[1,670],[15,75],[20,230],[25,163],[30,404],[37,235],[44,348],[51,241],[63,669]],"machine":[280,450,331,203,412,263,206,374,202,416,447,803,580,63,282,437,141,490,345,572,398,676,182,240,156,184,402,806,214,76,669,164,241,14,36,851,885,311,404],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me5-4","name":"Lurantis ex","set":"Pitch Black","date":"2026-07-17","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"4","artist